  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "碩士論文",
    "sub_ename": "MASTER THESIS",
    "describe_ch": "這門課是針對學生的論文寫作與指導教授之間的研討而設計。為加強學生執行研究與解決問題的能力，本課程要求學生針對學術或產業問題進行專業探討，進而拉近理論與實務之間的距離。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed for the dissertation writing and the discussion between students and supervisors. In order to strengthen students' ability to perform research and problem-solving, this course requires students to conduct professional researches on academic or industrial topics, thereby narrowing the distance between theory and practice.",
